From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: David Sanders <dsanders11@ucsbalum.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 21:01:19 -0700
Subject: Add missing includes of standard library headers

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5

Cherry-picked from upstream ada commit
https://github.com/ada-url/ada/commit/afb8a1e3099cd903f92f3add4b7efec4f5c6ffcd
and ported to the vendored amalgamation (deps/ada/ada.h and
deps/ada/ada.cpp). Needed for building with clang modules, since ada.h
uses e.g. std::pair, std::vector and std::same_as without including
their headers. The changes to url_pattern_list and
unicode_percent_encode are omitted as those files are not in the
vendored ada 4.0.0.

This patch can be removed when Node.js updates to an ada release that
contains this change.

